STRING 2169
{
Quiet. I hear voices up ahead.
}

STRING 2170
{
The Knights of the Silver Hand. We have to get rid of them. Now!
}

STRING 2171
{
Who are the Silver Hand?
}

STRING 2172
{
Fanatics who worship the Holy Light. They see us as anathema and want to purge us from the world.
}

STRING 2180
{
Agreed. There may be citizens in the Undercity that still need our help, as well.
}

STRING 2181
{
We should provision ourselves and recruit troops before proceeding. Once we enter the cathedral, there will be no turning back.
}

STRING 2182
{
My memories... will they ever return?
}

STRING 2183
{
Perhaps, perhaps not. Each Forsaken experiences their awakening differently.
}

STRING 2184
{
Either way, your former life is gone. Remake yourself in undeath.
}

STRING 2199
{
Plaguing the city’s water supply seems like an extreme measure.
}

STRING 2200
{
Only the Forsaken call the Undercity home. Making it inhospitable is the perfect defense against the living.
}

STRING 2201
{
Do the living hate us that much? We share a common enemy in the Scourge.
}

STRING 2202
{
As far as the living are concerned, the Forsaken and the Scourge are one and the same.
}

STRING 2208
{
Edric’s eye is a powerful magical trinket. One that he keeps misplacing.
}

STRING 2209
{
We can return it to him and wait for him to lose it again, or we can equip it ourselves. Your choice.
}

